<title>HONG KONG: Logic names chief execuitve officer.</title>
<headline>Logic names chief execuitve officer.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logic International Holdings Ltd said its has appointed executive director Frank Lai as Chief Executive Officer with effective from Janaury 27 in a move to unify and strengthen the management structure of the company.</p>
<p>The office furniture distributor also said Simon Ngan has resigned as executive director and director of the company with effect from the same date due to his plan of emigrate.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
